@startuml
title SD01 - Calculate order discounts (UC05 / AD05 / AD28)
autonumber

actor "Sales employee" as Sales
participant "order:Order" as O
participant "customer:Customer" as C
participant "discount:CustomerDiscount" as D

Sales -> O: calculateTotalAmount()
activate O
O -> O: calculateOrderDiscount()
note right of O: 5% order discount from EUR 500 (case: orders).

alt First order of customer
  O -> O: calculateOneTimeDiscount()
  note right of O
    First order: 10% discount (Product-description).
    Do not apply the same first-order allowance twice.
  end note
else Returning customer
  note right of O: No first-order discount.
end

O -> C: calculateAnnualRevenue(previousYear)
activate C
C --> O: revenue from paid purchases in preceding year
deactivate C
O -> D: determinePercentage(previousYearRevenue, currentYear)
activate D
D --> O: 5%, 10% or 15% (case turnover table)
deactivate D
O -> O: calculateCustomerDiscount()
note right of O
  Apply customer discount after the order discount
  and the one-time discount, if applicable.
  Annual percentage is set on 31 December for next year.
end note
O --> Sales: order subtotal, three discount amounts, final total
deactivate O
@enduml
